* Toppar stream file generated by FFParam cgenfftoconverter
* For use with Drude force field
*

ioformat extended

read rtf card append
* Topologies generated by FFParam cgenfftoconverter
* For use with Drude force field
*
44

AUTO ANGL DIHE DRUD

! Converts cgenff atomtype to drude atom types.
! Charges are picked from cgenff stream file
! Alpha and Thole values are picked from first match of atom type in a text file containing all currently available residues.
! If it cannot find the values -1.0 and -1.3 values are assigned to the atom type.

RESI  BUTA     -1.0000
GROUP
ATOM C1     CD33A         -0.273  ALPHA   -1.8119  THOLE   1.1867
ATOM C2     CD32A         -0.173  ALPHA   -1.5966  THOLE   1.1693
ATOM C3     CD32A         -0.284  ALPHA   -1.5966  THOLE   1.1693
ATOM C4     CD2O2A         0.620  ALPHA   -1.0160  THOLE   0.8990
ATOM O1     OD2C2A         0.000  ALPHA   -0.6990  THOLE   2.3990 ! You may also consider OD2C1C  OD2C3A Equivalent Atomtypes
ATOM O2     OD2C2A         0.000  ALPHA   -0.6990  THOLE   2.3990 ! You may also consider OD2C1C  OD2C3A Equivalent Atomtypes
ATOM H1     HDA3A          0.090 
ATOM H2     HDA3A          0.090 
ATOM H3     HDA3A          0.090 
ATOM H4     HDA2A          0.090 
ATOM H5     HDA2A          0.090 
ATOM H6     HDA2A          0.090 
ATOM H7     HDA2A          0.090 
ATOM H8     DUMH          0.000 
ATOM H9     DUMH          0.000 
ATOM LPO11  LPD         -0.380
ATOM LPO12  LPD         -0.380
ATOM LPO21  LPD         -0.380
ATOM LPO22  LPD         -0.380

BOND C1  C2 
BOND C1  H1 
BOND C1  H2 
BOND C1  H3 
BOND C2  C3 
BOND C2  H4 
BOND C2  H5 
BOND C3  C4 
BOND C3  H6 
BOND C3  H7 
BOND C4  O1 
BOND C4  O2 
BOND O2  H8
BOND O1  H9 
BOND  LPO11  O1 
BOND  LPO12  O1 
BOND  LPO21  O2 
BOND  LPO22  O2 

LONE RELATIVE LPO11  O1  C4  C3 DIST 0.3500 ANGLE  110.00 DIHE    0.00
LONE RELATIVE LPO12  O1  C4  C3 DIST 0.3500 ANGLE  110.00 DIHE  180.00
LONE RELATIVE LPO21  O2  C4  C3 DIST 0.3500 ANGLE  110.00 DIHE    0.00
LONE RELATIVE LPO22  O2  C4  C3 DIST 0.3500 ANGLE  110.00 DIHE  180.00
END


read param card append
