!CD33A   CD32A   CD32A   HDA2A   0.190  3  0.000   ! from CD33A CD32A CD32A HDA2A  PENALTY 112.000
!CD32A   CD32A   CD2O2A   OD2C2A   0.200  3  0.000   ! from CD32A CD32A CD2O2A OD2C2A  PENALTY 266.000
!CD32A   CD32A   CD33A   HDA3A   0.140  3  0.000   ! from CD32A CD32A CD33A HDA3A  PENALTY 118.000
CD2O2A   CD32A   CD32A   HDA2A   0.156  3  0.000   ! from CD2C1A CD32A CD32A HDA2A  PENALTY 62.000
!OD2C2A   CD2O2A   CD32A   HDA2A   0.420  3  180.000   ! from OD2C2A CD2O2A CD32A HDA2A  PENALTY 370.000
